From c5faab55752aa6a9f0bc28446e943f0ab022a1b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:07:47 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] v850: Add mg4mh2 and the RH850 G4MH2 instructions

Add the option for the RH850 G4MH2 core with its MPU and guest register
transfer instructions and its additional system register names.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
